  {
    "id": "ig_ucr_trc_p3986978176962716648",
    "title": "Tomás Rivera Conference",
    "description": "Giants of Chicano film, literature to headline this year's Tomás Rivera Conference\n\n📅Oct. 15 at 5 p.m.\n📍UC Riverside University Theatre\n\nLuis Valdez wrote and directed “Zoot Suit” (1978), the first Chicano play produced on Broadway, as well as the 1981 film version of it. Severo Pérez directed and wrote the screenplay for “...And the Earth Did Not Swallow Him,” the 1994 film based on Tomás Rivera’s seminal novel from 1971.\n\n🔗https://monkeylink.co/e8e0d6\nLINK IN BIO",
    "starts_at": "2026-10-16T00:00:00+00:00",
    "ends_at": "2026-10-16T03:00:00+00:00",
